      "text": "stomach"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:08",
      "text": "leaves however are not easily digested"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:12",
      "text": "the slaves technique is to give them"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:14",
      "text": "time"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:18",
      "text": "then eventually this mobile compost heap"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:22",
      "text": "pulls itself together and starts on a"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:24",
      "text": "long and dangerous journey"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:28",
      "text": "this is a very unusual sight"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:31",
      "text": "a sloth in a hurry"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:33",
      "text": "it wants to defecate and the only place"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:36",
      "text": "it's happy doing that oddly enough is"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:38",
      "text": "down on the ground"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:42",
      "text": "it only does it about once a week"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:44",
      "text": "but why does it come down to the ground"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:46",
      "text": "to do it"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:48",
      "text": "and why does it nearly always choose to"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:50",
      "text": "do so in exactly the same place whatever"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:54",
      "text": "the reason it must be very important for"
    },
    {
      "time": "8:56",
      "text": "a sloth on the ground is almost helpless"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:01",
      "text": "any predator could attack it and it"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:03",
      "text": "doesn't have the speed to escape"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:06",
      "text": "why it comes down in this way"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:08",
      "text": "is a mystery nobody knows"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:11",
      "text": "now he's finished"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:14",
      "text": "and back he goes up to the safety of the"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:16",
      "text": "canopy"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:18",
      "text": "leaves are not very nutritious"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:20",
      "text": "the sloth's way of compensating for that"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:23",
      "text": "is not to eat more but to do less"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:26",
      "text": "its claws hook over the branches so that"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:28",
      "text": "the sloth can hang without any effort of"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:30",
      "text": "its muscles which have been reduced to"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:32",
      "text": "thin ribbons and to save energy it"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:35",
      "text": "spends most of its time hanging around"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:37",
      "text": "half asleep in the treetops"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:42",
      "text": "so with very little muscle"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:45",
      "text": "and a reaction time only a quarter as"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:47",
      "text": "fast as ours how does a sloth's day"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:50",
      "text": "compare with our day"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:53",
      "text": "in the time it takes me to write a few"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:55",
      "text": "letters the sloth just about manages to"
    },
    {
      "time": "9:58",
      "text": "groom itself"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:00",
      "text": "while we have our lunch the sloth levels"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:02",
      "text": "a few"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:04",
      "text": "and then as we film the sequence for the"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:07",
      "text": "series it's time for another nap"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:10",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:13",
      "text": "hua"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:14",
      "text": "a three month old female"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:17",
      "text": "abandoned by her mother after only a few"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:19",
      "text": "days she is being hand-reared"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:24",
      "text": "pandas have twins 50 of the time but"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:27",
      "text": "choose only to keep the strongest"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:30",
      "text": "it's nature's survival of the fittest"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:32",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:34",
      "text": "junghwa wasn't chosen by her mum"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:37",
      "text": "so the nannies go out of their way to"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:39",
      "text": "spoil her rotten"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:44",
      "text": "she has already outgrown her incubator"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:47",
      "text": "and is piling on the pounds"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:50",
      "text": "puppy fat on a baby panda is good"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:53",
      "text": "at 11 pounds ying hua is filling out"
    },
    {
      "time": "10:56",
      "text": "well"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:00",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:02",
      "text": "you need to know your pandas growing"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:04",
      "text": "properly so everything is weighed and"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:06",
      "text": "measured"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:14",
      "text": "they're robust at this age and a little"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:16",
      "text": "bang is all part of the fun"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:21",
      "text": "when baby mammals are hand reared you"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:23",
      "text": "have to do everything that mum does"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:25",
      "text": "and that includes encouraging them to"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:27",
      "text": "wee and poop"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:29",
      "text": "in the wild they can't do this on their"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:31",
      "text": "own so mum helps by licking their behind"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:35",
      "text": "tapping yinghua's back end is the next"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:37",
      "text": "best option and simulates what panda"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:40",
      "text": "mums do with their tongue to encourage"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:42",
      "text": "going to the toilet"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:44",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:49",
      "text": "this will need to be done on each panda"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:51",
      "text": "multiple times a day"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:53",
      "text": "pretty much after every feed"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:57",
      "text": "so when you count them all up"
    },
    {
      "time": "11:59",
      "text": "that's a lot of toilet training"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:02",
      "text": "with the herd staying in one place"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:04",
      "text": "our spy cams can be everywhere"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:08",
      "text": "even a tree stump spies on the calf's"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:11",
      "text": "every movement"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:22",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:33",
      "text": "boulder cam was first used in a film"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:36",
      "text": "that spied on lions"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:38",
      "text": "now it finds a new generation to"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:41",
      "text": "entertain"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:44",
      "text": "as always the lion's first reaction is"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:47",
      "text": "curiosity"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:50",
      "text": "but these cats are more inquisitive than"
    },
    {
      "time": "12:53",
      "text": "most"
    },
    {
      "time": "13:06",
      "text": "one cub has taken to it in a big way"
    },
    {
      "time": "13:16",
      "text": "boulder cam doubles up as a baby walker"
    },
    {
      "time": "13:26",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "14:08",
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "time": "14:13",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "14:32",
      "text": "you"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:00\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:03\n    ",
      "text": "but before being reunited with her"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:05\n    ",
      "text": "family"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:06\n    ",
      "text": "she still has a mountain to climb"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:12\n    ",
      "text": "it's a big ask for a bird that can't fly"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:15\n    ",
      "text": "standing less than half a meter tall"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:19\n    ",
      "text": "but it's now that rockhoppers live up to"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:21\n    ",
      "text": "their name"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:29\n    ",
      "text": "incredibly strong toenails grip the rock"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:37\n    ",
      "text": "the beak makes a good climbing tool"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:43\n    ",
      "text": "the more experienced penguins make it"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:45\n    ",
      "text": "look easy"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:46\n    ",
      "text": "but it's a steep learning curve"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:51\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      0:58\n    ",
      "text": "it takes youngsters a while to get the"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:00\n    ",
      "text": "hang of it"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:07\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:11\n    ",
      "text": "judge it and it's back to square one"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:14\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:29\n    ",
      "text": "at the top of the cliff the going gets a"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:31\n    ",
      "text": "little easier"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:40\n    ",
      "text": "following the footsteps of generations"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:42\n    ",
      "text": "forging deep tunnels through the tussock"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:44\n    ",
      "text": "grass"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:54\n    ",
      "text": "these pathways connect around 20"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:56\n    ",
      "text": "different colonies spreading up the"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      1:58\n    ",
      "text": "hillside"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:01\n    ",
      "text": "she's got to find her way through nearly"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:03\n    ",
      "text": "half a million rock hoppers"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:06\n    ",
      "text": "but she knows where she's going"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:08\n    ",
      "text": "returning to the same colony each year"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:14\n    ",
      "text": "unfortunately that happens to be at the"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:16\n    ",
      "text": "very top of the island"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:19\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:29\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:35\n    ",
      "text": "finally"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:36\n    ",
      "text": "after a climb of two kilometers"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:39\n    ",
      "text": "she's made"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      2:40\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:01\n    ",
      "text": "and at last it's time for dinner"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:05\n    ",
      "text": "it's a messy business"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:07\n    ",
      "text": "but the chicks not complaining"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:25\n    ",
      "text": "the arctic"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:27\n    ",
      "text": "millions of square kilometers of empty"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:30\n    ",
      "text": "ice"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:37\n    ",
      "text": "polar bears are normally solitary"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:40\n    ",
      "text": "you might think that just finding a"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:42\n    ",
      "text": "partner in this desolate landscape would"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:44\n    ",
      "text": "be the challenge"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:45\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:48\n    ",
      "text": "but they have an excellent sense of"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:49\n    ",
      "text": "smell"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:51\n    ",
      "text": "and can detect another bear from over"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:53\n    ",
      "text": "the horizon"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      3:57\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:03\n    ",
      "text": "male bears can spend weeks tracking the"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:06\n    ",
      "text": "scent of a female who's ready to mate"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:31\n    ",
      "text": "they sniff closely to size each other up"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:40\n    ",
      "text": "she'll raise her cubs alone devoting"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:43\n    ",
      "text": "herself to them for two even three years"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:47\n    ",
      "text": "it's a huge commitment of time and"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:49\n    ",
      "text": "effort"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:50\n    ",
      "text": "so it's vital to pick a male who will"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:52\n    ",
      "text": "provide strong and healthy genes for her"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:55\n    ",
      "text": "offspring"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      4:59\n    ",
      "text": "it looks as though she's going to put"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:00\n    ",
      "text": "this potential shooter through his paces"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:07\n    ",
      "text": "she needs him up and down the slopes"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:10\n    ",
      "text": "it's as if she's testing his fitness"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:22\n    ",
      "text": "they start to play"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:24\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:29\n    ",
      "text": "courtship is one of the few times that"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:32\n    ",
      "text": "adult animals play together"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      5:34\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:09\n    ",
      "text": "this slope is rather steep for the"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:12\n    ",
      "text": "heavier male"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:14\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:23\n    ",
      "text": "it's no good he can't quite manage it"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:27\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:35\n    ",
      "text": "but she seems to have decided that he"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:37\n    ",
      "text": "might be the one"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:39\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:40\n    ",
      "text": "whilst he seems to have lost interest"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:45\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:49\n    ",
      "text": "it's her turn to do the chasing"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:52\n    ",
      "text": "and she's got a few tricks up her sleeve"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      6:57\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:08\n    ",
      "text": "do"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:14\n    ",
      "text": "[Music]"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:19\n    ",
      "text": "that was enough to entice him up again"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:23\n    ",
      "text": "in this tree there is one of the most"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:26\n    ",
      "text": "extraordinary plant predators"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:31\n    ",
      "text": "it's one animal that i don't need to"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:34\n    ",
      "text": "sneak up on"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:40\n    ",
      "text": "this"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:41\n    ",
      "text": "extraordinary creature is half blind"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:44\n    ",
      "text": "half death"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:45\n    ",
      "text": "and this is just about as fast as it can"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:48\n    ",
      "text": "move"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:50\n    ",
      "text": "that's what can happen to you"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:52\n    ",
      "text": "if you live on nothing but leaves"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:55\n    ",
      "text": "it's a sloth"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      7:57\n    ",
      "text": "it's not exactly an enthusiastic leaf"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:00\n    ",
      "text": "eater a couple of half-hearted chews and"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:03\n    ",
      "text": "the leaves go straight down to its"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:05\n    ",
      "text": "stomach"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:08\n    ",
      "text": "leaves however are not easily digested"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:12\n    ",
      "text": "the slaves technique is to give them"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:14\n    ",
      "text": "time"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:18\n    ",
      "text": "then eventually this mobile compost heap"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:22\n    ",
      "text": "pulls itself together and starts on a"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:24\n    ",
      "text": "long and dangerous journey"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:28\n    ",
      "text": "this is a very unusual sight"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:31\n    ",
      "text": "a sloth in a hurry"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:33\n    ",
      "text": "it wants to defecate and the only place"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:36\n    ",
      "text": "it's happy doing that oddly enough is"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:38\n    ",
      "text": "down on the ground"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:42\n    ",
      "text": "it only does it about once a week"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:44\n    ",
      "text": "but why does it come down to the ground"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:46\n    ",
      "text": "to do it"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:48\n    ",
      "text": "and why does it nearly always choose to"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:50\n    ",
      "text": "do so in exactly the same place whatever"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:54\n    ",
      "text": "the reason it must be very important for"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      8:56\n    ",
      "text": "a sloth on the ground is almost helpless"
    },
    {
      "time": "\n      9:01\n    ",
      "text": "any predator could attack it and it"
    },
